        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/4af34b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-17T18:42:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For the Baseleios card:</p><p>If you play it during the Requisition phase, can the other SF player put a Tech on a ship, have the Baseleios remove it with Elaborate Muntions (EM), and then just play the same Tech again?</p><p>There doesn't seem to be a downside to EM otherwise. Maybe there wasn't supposed to be, but it still seems kinda... odd.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:02.092Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
