        "raw": "<p>For the Baseleios card:</p><p>If you play it during the Requisition phase, can the other SF player put a Tech on a ship, have the Baseleios remove it with Elaborate Muntions (EM), and then just play the same Tech again?</p><p>There doesn&#39;t seem to be a downside to EM otherwise. Maybe there wasn&#39;t supposed to be, but it still seems kinda... odd.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
